dralialsherif.com

# HOW TO USE
# 1. Buy the domain (e.g. dralialsherif.com or a .ae domain).
# 2. Rename this file to exactly:  CNAME   (no extension), one line, your domain.
# 3. At your DNS provider add either:
#      - four A records for the apex @  ->  185.199.108.153 / .109.153 / .110.153 / .111.153
#      - and a CNAME for www  ->  dralialsherif.github.io
# 4. GitHub repo → Settings → Pages → set the custom domain, tick "Enforce HTTPS".
# 5. Replace every https://dralialsherif.github.io/dralialsherif-site-v2 reference
#    with https://<your-domain> in: index.html, ar/index.html, sitemap.xml,
#    robots.txt, and the workshop pages (tools/build.py does this in bulk).
